OL,3,GNEWSALasers vaporise graffiti on
OL,4,ABrighton's 'awful' street
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeams have been deployed to deep clean
OL,7,Fa road in Brighton which one resident
OL,8,Fdescribed as "awful" due to the amount
OL,9,Fof graffiti and litter.
OL,11,FBrighton & Hove City Council workers
OL,12,Fwere out in St James' Street on Monday
OL,13,Fwith jet washers, brushes and lasers
OL,14,Fwhich vaporise graffiti.
OL,16,FResidents and shop workers welcomed the
OL,17,Fclean up, but feared rubbish would
OL,18,Freturn in a matter of days.
OL,20,FThe council said the day of action was
OL,21,Fabout "creating cleaner, safer and more
OL,22,Fwelcoming neighbourhoods".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
